        "passage_id": "P001",
        "quote": "Judgment, Supreme Court, Bronx County (Alexander W. Hunter, Jr., J.), entered October 21, 2008, in an action for personal injuries sustained in a trip and fall on defendant’s premises, upon a jury verdict in defendant’s favor, dismissing the complaint, unanimously affirmed, without costs.",
