        "evidence_id": "E003",
        "passage_id": "P001",
        "quote": "The trial court included in the jury’s verdict sheet a question, question No. 7, asking whether plaintiff suffered a traumatic tear of the knee as a result of her fall on defendant’s premises, to which the jury unanimously answered “No.” In response to a previous question, the jury unanimously answered “Yes” as to whether defendant’s negligence was “a substantial factor in causing [plaintiffs] accident.” During trial, the issue of whether plaintiffs knee injury was degenerative in nature or caused by trauma was in dispute. Although question No. 7 should have *544 been framed in terms of proximate cause and should have asked whether the accident or defendant’s negligence was a proximate cause of plaintiffs knee injury, rather than a “traumatic tear,” the actual terms of the question do not warrant a new trial.",
